Grammar

Rule 0     S' -> sec
Rule 1     sec -> sec instr
Rule 2     sec -> comienza
Rule 3     instr -> este
Rule 4     instr -> norte
Rule 5     instr -> oeste
Rule 6     instr -> sur

Terminals, with rules where they appear

comienza             : 2
error                : 
este                 : 3
norte                : 4
oeste                : 5
sur                  : 6

Nonterminals, with rules where they appear

instr                : 1
sec                  : 1 0

Parsing method: LALR

state 0

    (0) S' -> . sec
    (1) sec -> . sec instr
    (2) sec -> . comienza

    comienza        shift and go to state 2

    sec                            shift and go to state 1

state 1

    (0) S' -> sec .
    (1) sec -> sec . instr
    (3) instr -> . este
    (4) instr -> . norte
    (5) instr -> . oeste
    (6) instr -> . sur

    este            shift and go to state 4
    norte           shift and go to state 5
    oeste           shift and go to state 6
    sur             shift and go to state 7

    instr                          shift and go to state 3

state 2

    (2) sec -> comienza .

    este            reduce using rule 2 (sec -> comienza .)
    norte           reduce using rule 2 (sec -> comienza .)
    oeste           reduce using rule 2 (sec -> comienza .)
    sur             reduce using rule 2 (sec -> comienza .)
    $end            reduce using rule 2 (sec -> comienza .)


